--- a/src/tools/video-editor/runtime/element-adapter.ts
+++ b/src/tools/video-editor/runtime/element-adapter.ts
@@
 // After the panel and AgentChat callers have migrated and the equivalent
 // command tests exist, delete createElementTimelineRoutes,
 // AstridElementOperationAdapter.executeTimelineMutation, and their
 // saveTimelineAtHead/saveTimeline calls. Do not delete this route before
 // all callers use the qualified command producer.

Required tests before applying this shared patch:

  - existing clip revision command reaches Runtime /v1 commit;
  - literal params update preserves unknown/unmentioned fields;
  - selected project-pack revision/params carries the exact retained pin;
  - direct overlay, remove, transition, fade/entrance, and placement cases
    refuse visibly without a whole-document fallback;
  - acceptance -> reload -> guarded undo -> exact retry, then zero legacy
    element save traffic.

No browser or catalog-only validation is evidence for the retained pin or
Gate 5/6. The missing Agent contract is an operation for overlay creation,
element removal, transition assignment/removal, and full panel look semantics;
this patch must remain unapplied until those operations are either qualified
or explicitly surfaced as unsupported.
